        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The lifetime maximum benefit for all covered medical services (including prescription drugs) is $1,500,000, subject to all other medical plan provisions. This maximum applies separately to each covered family member. Benefits paid and applied to reduce the maximum benefit, while covered under a Company-sponsored plan for active or retired personnel and not reinstated under a prior agreement, are not reinstated by this agreement and serve to reduce the maximum benefits available hereunder.",
