        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The Traditional Medical Plan provides benefits for procedures, services, and supplies medically necessary for the diagnosis and/or therapeutic treatment of non-occupational accidental injuries or illnesses and treatment of certain listed conditions.",
