        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The Traditional Medical Plan has a medical review program to encourage appropriate utilization of health care services. The program includes precertification requirements, voluntary second surgical opinion provisions, a referral service for mental illness and substance abuse treatment, and individual case management.",
